  "instructions": [
    "in a large hot-pot, heat the vegan butter over medium heat.",
    "add the onions and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "add the garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "add the carrots, potatoes, parsnips, and red cabbage, and cook for 5 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "add the apple cider vinegar, mustard seeds, thyme, parsley, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "add the oat milk and bring to a simmer.",
    "reduce the heat to low and cook, covered, for 20 minutes, or until the vegetables are tender.",
    "stir in the crushed oats, chopped walnuts, and chopped parsley.",
    "cook for an additional 2-3 minutes, or until the oats are toasted and the liquid has thickened slightly.",
    "serve hot, garnished with additional parsley if desired."
  ],
